 "remarks": "Experience luxurious, carefree living in this immaculate tri-level townhouse, located less than a mile from the heart of town. Featuring an attached two-car garage, this home boasts 9' ceilings, hardwood floors, and recessed lighting throughout. The open-concept living/dining area is highlighted by a bay window, tray ceiling, and deck access. The chef's kitchen features cherry cabinets, granite countertops, and stainless steel appliances. Upstairs, enjoy the convenience of a bedroom-level laundry, plus a master suite with a walk-in closet and a full bath (soaking tub + shower). Additional perks include two-zone gas heat, central AC, and attic storage. Walk to downtown restaurants, theaters, and the Bedford Street farmers market!",
